### 4. Add Bind Method to API ([kodi-kotlin/src/main/kotlin/com/kodi/script/KodiScript.kt](file:///Users/issahamadoudicko/IdeaProjects/labo/kodi-script/kodi-kotlin/src/main/kotlin/com/kodi/script/KodiScript.kt))

In the [Builder](file:///Users/issahamadoudicko/IdeaProjects/labo/kodi-script/kodi-kotlin/src/main/kotlin/com/kodi/script/KodiScript.kt#40-74) class, after [registerFunction](file:///Users/issahamadoudicko/IdeaProjects/labo/kodi-script/kodi-kotlin/src/main/kotlin/com/kodi/script/KodiScript.kt#57-62) method (after line 61):

```kotlin
/** Bind a Kotlin object to the script context with reflective access. */
fun bind(name: String, obj: Any): Builder {
    variables[name] = obj
    return this
}
```

